    "pageid": 2593,
    "title": "Nova Monumenta Iaponiae Historica",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": ""
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Nova Monumenta Iaponiae Historica Mod (a.k.a. NMIH Mod) is a Crusader Kings 2 Mod about Japanese medieval era, called Sengoku Jidai ."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Description",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "This mod will contain following features."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Two Genpei scenarios (1180) and the Sengoku era where you can start the game on any date between 1493 and 1582.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Map based on the historical provinces. Similar to the Sengoku map, but more historically accurate for the 16th century.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "historical settlements such as castles, cities and manors. The starting and max. number of baronies in each province is based on surveys in the 16th and 19th centuries.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Historical buddhist revolters such as Ikko Shu and Hokke Shu.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Interaction with the Imperial Court and the Shogunate.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Events with Westerners.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Japanese localization of vanilla features.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Portraits of historical pictures.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Original 3D unit models.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Requirement",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Crusader Kings II",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Rajas of India DLC (Few Christian daimyos in late scenarios e.g. Otomo Sorin) are playable without Raja of India DLC)",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
